# Artifact Registry Setup
RULE: Use idempotent publishing pattern with version-commit mapping in GCS. Same commit = skip, different commit = fail.
WHY: Prevents accidental version overwrites; ensures version immutability; supports safe rebuilds.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/artifact-registry-setup.md
DO: Store version→commit mapping before upload; bump version on conflict; use semantic versioning
NEVER: Overwrite existing versions; publish without quality gates; skip version validation
